{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"kouSteinerTree","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"terminals","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SteinerTree","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SpanningTrees11SteinerTreeV","identifier":"doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/SteinerTree"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">? ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AdditiveArithmetic","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18AdditiveArithmeticP"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Comparable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SL"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"terminals","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The vertices to connect.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"weight","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each edge’s weight, from its position."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tree’s edges, in position order, and their total weight."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A Dijkstra search from each terminal gives the distances between terminals; a minimum"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spanning tree of that complete distance graph is expanded into its shortest paths; and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tree is a minimum spanning tree of those paths’ edges with every leaf that is not a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"terminal pruned, repeatedly. Its weight is at most 2(1 − 1\/ℓ) times the optimum, where ℓ is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the number of leaves of an optimal tree."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Repeated terminals count once. With fewer than two terminals the tree has no edges. Every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"edge that is not a self-loop is weighed once; ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"weight"},{"text":" is not kept.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Complexity","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(t (m + n) log n + t²) for t terminals, with O(t n) memory."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"Precondition","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every terminal is a vertex; every weight is at least zero and not NaN; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"path lengths do not overflow."}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/spanningtrees\/graphprotocols\/graph\/kousteinertree(terminals:weight:)"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"fileName":"SteinerTree.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/SpanningTrees\/SteinerTree.swift#L96"},"title":"kouSteinerTree(terminals:weight:)","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"SpanningTrees"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"kouSteinerTree","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"terminals","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifi